  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SO2: Financial performance of water and wastewater SPs and RWUs improved</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial performance of water and wastewater SPs and RWUs 
2.1: 
60% of SPs and RWUs are trained on financial data collection, submission, and analysis by the end of the 1rst year.
 2.2: 
30 SPs and RWUs tariff reviewed and submitted to Cabinet of Ministers.
 2.3: 
30 Individual targets set and monitored for SPs and RWUs water bill collection rate and 10% of SPs and RWUs that comply to the tariff set by the COM (West bank only).
 2.4: Inform PWA on financial components to be included in the draft regulation for the performance incentives program.</narrative>
  </description>
