   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">30 Individual targets set and monitored for SPs and RWUs water bill collection rate and all SPs and RWUs comply to the tariff set by the COM (West bank only).</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial indicators are avital part of performance monitoring, for this reason the working ratio and the collection rate were monitored for all SPs during this process; taking into consideration that the optimal collection rate is 100% and the optimal working ratio is 1 or less.
 
On the compliance of endorsed tariff, only 4 SPs out of 33 (total number of accumulative endorsed tariffs) complied to the newly tariff implementation due to the current political and economic situations.</narrative>
   </description>
